contents = "SATO WU-HARA: Hey Dre, how you been? How’s the next DEVO going did you get to compete in the finals?

DRE: Hey dude, honestly all good just been hustling with the livestreams and making YouTube work! I’m finally at 100k subscribers but still scraping off making money by winning my locals. Hoping to make it work through more Patreon supporters. Finals was no biggie, just did my thing I haven’t felt much challenge East since I messed with Arooj! Which reminds me we gotta play some games online whenever he’s done with med school. Btw how’s your comic going?


SATO WU-HARA:
Honestly it’s going I’m striving for doing something that’s similar t autobio comics mixed with a sports comic. I also just want to honor the legacy of comics that I dig. There’s so many creators I wanna honor! 

DRE: I’m all ears for some comics creator recommendations! 

SATO WU-HARA: 
Okay, there are the obvious people Jack Kirby, Osamu Tezuka, Kentaro Miura, Katsuhiro Otomo.

DRE: Well bro, Im never gonna finish this list but I love to see you give credit to the GOATs.
"
